<br class="ltx_break">Interpreting Vision-Language Models with <span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">VLM-Lens<span id="id1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright" style="position:relative; bottom:-3.9pt;"><img src="2510.02292v1/figs/logo.png" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:25/25;" width="25" height="25" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span></span></h1>
