</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt" style="padding:-1pt 3.8pt;"><span id="S4.T1.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Answer</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
