<tr id="S4.T1.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-bottom: 4.0pt;padding:-1pt 3.8pt;"><span id="S4.T1.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">color</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-bottom: 4.0pt;padding:-1pt 3.8pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.2.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:224.3pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.2.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">There is a small cylinder that is made of the same material as the big brown thing; what color is it?</span>
</span></td>
