<span id="S4.T1.2.1.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:224.3pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.2.1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">What is the material of the big object that is the same color as the small metal cylinder?</span>
